OL,3,AUS strikes Iran as state media reports
OL,4,Afour killed at wedding party
OL,5,
OL,6,FCentcom said the strikes followed
OL,7,F"recent attempted attacks" by the
OL,8,FIslamic Revolutionary Guard Corps
OL,9,F(IRGC) against commercial shipping in
OL,10,Fthe Strait of Hormuz and "American
OL,11,Fservice members deployed to the
OL,12,Fregion".
OL,14,FThe IRGC said the US would regret the
OL,15,Fstrikes, and Iranian news agencies
OL,16,Freported that retaliatory missile and
OL,17,Fdrone attacks on US targets had begun.
